# Minimal model for the stochastics menu's Fourier-family known-answer
# tests (W31a: tests/test_stochast_fourier.cpp). The ODE itself never
# runs: the test fills storage[][] directly with signals of known
# amplitude/frequency and calls the same core functions the stocHast
# menu's Fourier series (f), power spectrum (p), correlations (x) and
# windowed spectral density (e) items call (new_four, just_fourier,
# new_hist, just_sd), then checks the results against values computed
# from first principles in the test.
